## 📚 Workflow Source DB (Read-Only)

### Access Pattern
**Package**: `workflows/order-processing/source-db/`  
**Access**: **Read-only** - never write to workflow source DB

```typescript
// ✅ Good: Read-only queries
const customer = await this.orderProcessingRepo
  .createQueryBuilder('c')
  .where('c.customer_id = :id', { id: customerId })
  .getOne();

// ❌ Bad: Never write to workflow source DB
await this.orderProcessingRepo.save(customer); // DON'T DO THIS
```

### Querying Source Schema
```typescript
// Table names include schema prefix
@Entity({ name: 'customers', schema: 'ecommerce' })
export class Customer {
  @Column({ name: 'customer_id', primary: true })
  customerId: number;

  @Column({ name: 'first_name' })
  firstName: string;
}

// Query using schema-qualified names
const customers = await this.repo
  .createQueryBuilder('c')
  .from('ecommerce.customers', 'c')
  .where('c.customer_id = :id', { id })
  .getRawMany();
```

